#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Hub panel: one drop-down panel for the hub tools, opened from the waybar icon.

Usage: panel [PAGE]      open on PAGE (sound, clipboard, capture, system, timer); closes it
                         when it is already open on that page, toggles it without PAGE
       panel --daemon    start hidden, so the first open is instant (niri startup)
       panel --quit

Pages: per-app volume with live sliders, clipboard history (cliphist) with search and pins,
screen capture tiles, live system graphs, and a timer that runs in the island.
Esc or a click outside closes it; Ctrl+Tab / Alt+1..5 switch pages, typing searches the clipboard.
"""
